# Razorkin Hordecaller: "Whenever you attack" triggers once per attack, however many creatures attack (CR 603.2c), and only for its
# controller's own attack. Bot1 casts it in turn 1 and attacks (one Gremlin). In turn 3 Bot1 attacks with the Hordecaller and the
# Gremlin together and gets exactly one more (the Gremlin is 1/1, so 5 damage in all: Bot2 is at 11 after 16 - 5). In turn 4 Bot2
# attacks with an Ornithopter and Bot1 makes none (battlefield: five Moxen, the Hordecaller, two Gremlins = 8).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Razorkin Hordecaller
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x18

